Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦  嗯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:08.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该尝尝这块起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have got to try this cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.34,0:00:10.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道   我的牙不能吃太甜的东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you know, I'm not that much of a sweet tooth--
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.43,0:00:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  好香浓\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, it's so creamy. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:18.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我吃过的最棒的起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. That's the best cheesecake I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.51,0:00:19.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在哪里买到它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Where did you get this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到家时它就已经放在门口了  应该是有人寄给我们的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was at the front door when I got home. Somebody sent it to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.44,0:00:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德   收件人可不是你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, this isn't addressed to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,收件人是楼下的布雷曼太太\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is addressed to Mrs. Braverman downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小偷\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没看名子就打开盒子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't read the box before I opened it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盒子已经打开   就无法退还了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you can't return a box after you opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.87,0:00:41.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为它太好吃了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Because it's too delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.87,0:00:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你偷了这个起司蛋糕   是犯错的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, you stole this cheesecake. That is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.50,0:00:48.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  没关系的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, it is going to be okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:51.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为布雷曼太太会免费再收到一个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because Mrs. Braverman is gonna send away for a free one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.42,0:00:53.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可是   双赢啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that way, we all win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.22,0:00:57.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一的输家是大型起司蛋糕店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only losers are the big cheesecake conglomerate:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.60,0:01:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"妈妈的小面包店"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Mama's Little Bakery."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.39,0:01:02.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得好难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I feel terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是个大坏蛋  大坏蛋  大坏人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a horrible, horrible, horrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.52,0:01:08.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  你说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm sorry, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.94,0:01:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第11集  起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E11 The One With All The Cheesecakes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:18.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.32,0:01:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.62,0:01:24.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.29,0:01:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.67,0:01:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.13,0:01:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.56,0:01:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,行了  我得走了  我今天工作很忙\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I should get going. Big day a work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.19,0:01:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道我怎么会昏迷不醒吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know how I'm in a coma?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.65,0:01:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天他们要帮我做检查   结果发现我没有脑死亡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Today they do a test on me and it turns out I'm not brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.32,0:02:00.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聪明先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah-ah, Mr. Smarty-Pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.37,0:02:04.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有脑死亡的是我演的角色\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just my character that's not brain-dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.54,0:02:07.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  今晚的事没取消吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, so Pheebs, still on for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然  八点见  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Absolutely. Okay. All right, I'll see you at 8. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西八点见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, what's at 8?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.34,0:02:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们约好吃晚餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I have dinner plans with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.09,0:02:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们大约一个月会约一次去讨论你们的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We get together about once a month to discuss the rest of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  我真的不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. Did not know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:23.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能说  你今天看起来很漂亮吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}May I say how lovely you look today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.64,0:02:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Duly noted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:27.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么  明天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, so for tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.73,0:02:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要租辆车一起开过去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...do you want to rent a car and drive down together or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.77,0:02:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.23,0:02:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬妮表妹的婚礼  明晚啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cousin Frannie's wedding. It's tomorrow night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被邀请了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were invited?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.70,0:02:42.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  我不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.95,0:02:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他们只邀请了爸跟妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean I knew Mom and Dad were invited. I thought that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.45,0:02:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七岁到九岁  芬妮跟我形影不离\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, from the ages of 7 to 9, Frannie and I were inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.87,0:02:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许九岁后  芬妮交了新朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe since the age of 9, Frannie's made some new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许这只是个误会  我打电话去问雪若阿姨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well l-look okay, it's probably just a mistake. Let me call Aunt Cheryl, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许他们邀请你了  只是请帖寄丢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Maybe you are invited and the invitation just got lost in the mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以打电话告诉她  我们小时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, you call her and tell her that, you know, when we were kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.64,0:03:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她的宝贝芬妮好几次想脱光我的衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...her precious little Frannie tried to undress me several times, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.19,0:03:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要不是我阻止了她  她也结不了婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I hadn't stopped her, there probably wouldn't be a wedding to go to.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也想脱我的衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She tried to undress me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.28,0:03:19.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前会帮葛兰表弟脱衣服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I used to undress my cousin Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔瑟夫法兰西斯崔比亚尼   你回家了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joseph Francis Tribbiani, are you home yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.54,0:03:32.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想他还没有回家  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I think he's still out. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.75,0:03:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉你   瑞秋凯伦葛林\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'll tell you, Rachel Karen Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:38.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟乔伊今晚有约  他留了这张字条给我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had plans with Joey tonight, and he left me this note.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.09,0:03:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"菲比  我没办法赴约  我有约会  待会再谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Pheebs, can't make it. Got a date. Talk to you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.43,0:03:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大爹地"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Big Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"大爹地"  那是我们之间的昵称\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Big Daddy"? Oh, that's a nickname we were trying out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道什么样的昵称  不会跟别人重复吗  "罗斯原子超人"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you know what nickname never caught on? "The Ross-a-tron."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔瑟夫法兰西斯回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Oh, here's Joseph Francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:01.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你干嘛叫我的全名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, what are you middle-naming me for'?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.07,0:04:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你留了字条\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I left you a note.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:05.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是你放我鸽子的好理由\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So what? That doesn't give you the right to ditch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:10.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你有机会上床  当然可以取消跟朋友的约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you can cancel plans with friends if there's a possibility for sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  他说的对  这是规则\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, he's right. That is the rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法接受这种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't accept this rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.92,0:04:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们约好后  我期待你会出现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When we make plans, I expect you to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是你泡到马子前打发时间的代替品\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I can't just be a way to kill time till you meet someone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:24.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男女朋友来来去去   但朋友是一辈子的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, boyfriends and girlfriends are gonna come and go, but this is for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.89,0:04:28.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很抱歉   我不知道这对你来说那么重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow. I'm so sorry. I had no idea it would bother you this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.14,0:04:30.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  它的确很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以弥补你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, can I make it up to you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.39,0:04:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.81,0:04:38.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天晚上一起吃饭吧   我会自己付钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How about dinner tomorrow night? I'll pay for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你说服了我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you wore me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:48.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  既然你站在那边  就拿罐啤酒给 "罗斯原子超人"吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey Joe, while you're over there, how about another beer for "The Ross-a-tron"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.08,0:04:51.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"罗斯" 它又回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Ross--" Is that back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.29,0:04:59.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又有起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. The other cheesecake came.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.88,0:05:02.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们又把它送到这里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They delivered it to the wrong address again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.13,0:05:05.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把它送到楼下去   能有什么问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So just bring it back downstairs. What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.14,0:05:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该怎么说再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't seem to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.76,0:05:12.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗  钱德  两天前我们才吃掉了一个蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you serious? Chandler, we ate an entire cheesecake two days ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.18,0:05:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还想再吃啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and you want more?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.39,0:05:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我已经忘记它的味道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I've forgotten what it tastes like, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.27,0:05:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它是起司蛋糕   很好吃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It was cheesecake. It was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它又香又浓   酥酥的饼干\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It had a buttery, crumbly, graham-cracker crust...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有味道非常浓郁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with a very rich...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.24,0:05:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但不油腻的奶油起司\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...yet light cream-cheese filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.66,0:05:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的嘴巴全是口水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, my whole mouth just filled with saliva. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:39.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  忘了它  我们只是饿了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know what? Forget it. We are just hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.29,0:05:41.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没吃午饭   所以头昏脑胀的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have not had lunch. We are just light-headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:45.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去吃午饭吧   忘了那个起司蛋糕吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So let us go out and have lunch and forget about the cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.76,0:05:47.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把它还回去  才不会被诱惑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah and we'll drop it off downstairs so that we're not tempted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.05,0:05:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好主意  你要去哪儿吃午饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good idea. Where do you wanna go to lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.64,0:05:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芝加哥小妈妈面包店\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mama's Little Bakery, Chicago, Illinois.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,梅尔多米死了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mel Torme died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.36,0:06:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  那是一年前的报纸了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, that paper's like a year old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:05.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就表示山姆古迪商店的大特卖结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, does that mean the Sam Goody's sale is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.45,0:06:08.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.74,0:06:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我终于收到雪若阿姨的回音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I finally heard back from Aunt Cheryl...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.91,0:06:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显地这不是误会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and apparently it wasn't a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚礼现场座位有限\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, there's limited seating in the hall--
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:21.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,座位有限  我是个瘦皮猴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Limited seating? I am just one tiny person.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是她不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well yeah, but she doesn't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.55,0:06:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说上次她看到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, the last time she saw you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.38,0:06:31.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会把婚礼用的小椅子给压垮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you would've turned one of those little wedding chairs into kindling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.18,0:06:36.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"座位有限"  真是个烂藉口\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Limited seating." That's such a lame excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.64,0:06:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不是她不邀请我的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not the reason why she's not inviting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.89,0:06:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那有什么大不了的呢  我没办法观礼  只能去吃喜酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the big deal? I wasn't even invited to the ceremony, just the reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.15,0:06:45.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果这能让你觉得开心一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And you know what? If it makes you feel any better...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.36,0:06:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,琼安跟我只会去亮个相\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Joan and I will just make an appearance...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:50.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会提早离开  以示抗议\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then we'll leave early as a sign of protest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.49,0:06:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,琼安  对  她是我的女伴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joan? Yeah, Joan Tedeschi, my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.74,0:06:56.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是语言学系的助教\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's an assistant professor in the Linguistics Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又高又漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tall, very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.96,0:07:02.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有些人说  别挑太魁梧的女孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And despite what some people say, not broad-backed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:06.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你收到的喜帖是 "请携伴参加"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. You got "Ross Geller and guest"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.84,0:07:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有被邀请  你却可以"携伴参加"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I wasn't invited, and you got "and guest"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我真的得解释罗斯的行为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, excuse me, I do have to interrupt on Ross' behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想规则也适用在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think the rule applies here y'know,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他有机会跟魁梧女人上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Since he has a chance to get on broad-back--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有那么魁梧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not broad-back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你得带我去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait a minute. You're bringing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.69,0:07:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我不能放琼安鸽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I can't cancel on Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  你没有听到吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why not? Did you not hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是语言学系的助教\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's an assistant professor in the Linguistics Department, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:32.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她们很辣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.41,0:07:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底为什么想去   是因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why do you want to come anyway? Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.95,0:07:38.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我表妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.83,0:07:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  我们是一起长大的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, we grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.00,0:07:45.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是家人  你知道吗  对我来说很重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Family, you know? And all that's important to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.25,0:07:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我带你去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, all right. I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.51,0:07:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去打电话给琼安\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll go call Joan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:55.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,家人应该要出席的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Family should be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.05,0:07:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是她的婚礼  她一生中最快乐的日子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is her wedding. Happiest day of her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:07:59.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们等着瞧吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We'll see. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.90,0:08:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你请我吃午餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, thank you for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  等一下  我以为你付了钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Wait a minute, I didn't pay. I thought you paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:11.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显的  我们不必再掏钱买食物了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So apparently, we just don't pay for food anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有看错吧  它还在那里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you see what I see? Huh! It's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:21.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,布雷曼太太一定是出去了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mrs. Braverman must be out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能出城去了  或许几个月后才会回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She could be out of town. Maybe she'll be gone for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.96,0:08:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到时候  蛋糕一定坏了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}By then, the cheesecake may have gone bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.01,0:08:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能让她回来时看到坏掉的起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We don't want her to come back to bad cheesecake.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她可能会中毒死掉   我不希望发生那种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No that could kill her. Well, we don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.93,0:08:35.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是在保护她\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No so we're protecting her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们把它拿走  但是要快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We should take it. But we should move quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:38.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  我听到她在里面走动的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Because I think I just heard her moving around in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:40.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快走  快走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Go! Go! Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  是大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, that's David.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.61,0:08:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁  那个科学家大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who? David, the scientist guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.57,0:08:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上了的那个大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}David that I was in love with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.24,0:08:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个去了俄罗斯伤了我的心的大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}David who went to Russia and broke my heart, David.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.61,0:08:55.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.86,0:08:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要一直念某人的名字  那个人就会转过身来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you say someone's name enough, they turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe. David.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.33,0:09:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么   你不是在俄罗斯吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here? Aren't you supposed to be in Russia?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我到城里来开会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm just in town for a conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.17,0:09:15.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你看起来美得出奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, God, you look phenomenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, ha, ha...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:18.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.01,0:09:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来也很棒  你剪了头发吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look great too. Did you get a haircut?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我大概剪了三十次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Well, I got like 3O of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:28.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我要跟你坦诚一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, look, I got a confession to make. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我希望能在这里遇到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Um, I was hoping to run into you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:34.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道该不该打电话给你  我只会在城里待几天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't know that I should call or not. You know, I was only in town a few days...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想打扰你的生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and, you know, I didn't want to intrude on your life or anything like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.03,0:09:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的想见你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I really wanted to see you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.20,0:09:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我不知道你要不要见我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I didn't know if you wanted to see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.95,0:09:48.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然想见你  我常常想到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course I would want to see you. I think about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.08,0:09:51.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  因为我也常常想到你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Because I think about you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  明斯克有一座雕像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? There's a statue in Minsk...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我常常想起你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that reminds me of you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:58.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实际上  那是列宁的雕像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, um, it's actually of Lenin...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但有些角度看起来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but, you know, at certain angles... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.14,0:10:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总之  今晚你想跟我共进晚餐吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, do you want to have dinner tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.23,0:10:09.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, no. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我不能\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, what? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.48,0:10:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信  我已经有约了  今天不行  明天可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I have plans. I can't. Can you do it tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:19.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  再过几小时我就得离开了  我得赶回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, no, I have to go in a few hours. I have to be on the redeye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.87,0:10:22.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  下次你到明斯克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, listen, you know, next time you're in Minsk, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我能跟你谈一谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Can I talk to you for a second? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.96,0:10:31.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今晚跟乔伊有约  所以呢  他会谅解的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I have plans with Joey tonight. So? He'll understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.79,0:10:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他不会的  那根本不是重点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he won't. And that's not even the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:39.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  我教训他不该见色忘友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica, I made a whole speech about how you do not cancel plans with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.26,0:10:44.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在呢   只因为可能是我真爱的人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now, you know, what? Just because, potentially, the love of my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明天就要回俄罗斯了  我就应该改变我的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...comes back from Russia just for one night, I should change my beliefs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.27,0:10:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我应该改变我的想法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I should change my beliefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.90,0:10:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  如果失去了原则   我什么都不会有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. No, no. If I don't have my principles, I don't have anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:10:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  你太有说服力了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, you are so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.15,0:11:02.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我可以赶快跟乔伊吃完晚餐  然后九点跟大卫见面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Or I should rush through dinner with Joey and I could meet David at 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.25,0:11:11.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  真的是太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, that is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.75,0:11:15.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我吃饱了  但我知道  如果我现在停下来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm full. And yet I know if I stop eating this...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会后悔的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'll regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.88,0:11:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你们在吃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, what have you got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.22,0:11:22.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, it's, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,豆腐蛋糕  你要吃一点吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}it's tofu cake. Do you want some? Aah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你要做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing tonight? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.23,0:11:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh. Dude. Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.73,0:11:38.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我跟菲比有约\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry. Uh, I got those plans with Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.24,0:11:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  摩妮卡说她九点有约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, really? Uh, Monica said she had a date at 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:44.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  今晚  摩妮卡是那么说的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Tonight? That's what Monica said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她教训了我一顿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}After she gave me that big speech...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,却同时约了我跟她的男伴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...she goes and makes a date on the same night she has plans with me'?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.33,0:11:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她想草草解决 "大爹地"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I think she's trying to pull a fast one on Big Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.21,0:12:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们的位置应该是这一桌\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh here, I think this is us. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.63,0:12:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还座位有限  屁话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Limited seating, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们来看看  谁被邀请了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's just see who made the cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  我是摩妮卡盖勒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi. I'm Monica Geller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.77,0:12:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们跟新人是什么关系   我是芬妮以前的同事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you know the bride and groom? I worked with Frannie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前的同事  以前\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Used to work with her. Used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是她的亲戚却没有被邀请\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm a relative and I didn't get invited, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.57,0:12:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是她的血亲  血\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A blood relative. Blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.70,0:12:24.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别在陌生人面前提到 "血"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stop saying "blood" to strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:28.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  你跟快乐的新人是什么关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So how about you? How do you know the happy couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:31.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是他们的大学同学  现在是他们的邻居\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We went to college with both of them. And now we live next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:34.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你还够格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:41.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要点菜了吗  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Are you guys ready? Hey. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.30,0:12:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要沙拉  特调酱汁  给我水就好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will have a green salad, urn, house dressing and water's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.30,0:12:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你呢  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. And for you, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  慢烤鲑鱼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. This slow-roasted salmon...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到底有多慢呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...just how slow are we talkin' here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.10,0:12:55.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它已经烤好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's already been roasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.44,0:12:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我不要了  麻烦你  再告诉我一次今日特餐\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, then no. Maybe I should hear those specials again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.48,0:13:02.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我们已经听了三次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Joey, we've heard the specials three times, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有烤肋排  鬼头刀鱼  跟特制龙虾饺子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's prime rib, mahi-mahi and a very special lobster ravioli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.57,0:13:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上我们没有饺子了  那我们得重来一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Actually, we're out of the lobster ravioli. Oh, well, that changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.37,0:13:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what, Pheebs? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,之前你说的话是对的  朋友太重要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You were right before. Friends are so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.13,0:13:20.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  我很聪明  我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I'm very wise. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.80,0:13:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我想做什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what I really want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:25.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我想花时间跟你长谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? ls to have a long, long talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:29.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗   多告诉我一点人生道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? Get Joey out on the open road and really open him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.01,0:13:32.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以点菜了吗  可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any progress? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.48,0:13:35.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要点龙虾饺子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will have the lobster ravioli.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  乔伊  这得花一辈子的时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}God, Joey, this is taking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.23,0:13:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在干嘛这么急   喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's the rush? Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I just have, you know, an appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.86,0:13:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它非常重要\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:49.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我约了一个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.16,0:13:54.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你约了男人  不  不  菲比  你一定弄错了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}A date? No, no, Pheebs, you must be mistaken...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.04,0:13:56.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你不能跟男人约会的同时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...because you wouldn't schedule a date...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:13:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又跟朋友约吃饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...on the night you have plans with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.83,0:14:00.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让我觉得内疚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on. Don't make me feel badly about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.88,0:14:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我就是要那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我跟那个女孩出去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. Yeah, you made me feel really guilty...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.42,0:14:07.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我觉得非常内疚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...about going outwith that girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.93,0:14:11.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像我做了什么可怕的事  菲比  现在你也那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Like I did something terrible to you. Now, Pheebs, you're doing the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.89,0:14:14.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我才不呢   这个完全不一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not the same thing. This is totally different.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.77,0:14:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟大卫有约  你还记得科学家大卫吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is with David. Remember David, the scientist guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.02,0:14:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说他非常特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, he's very special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:21.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那晚我约的女孩也很特别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, well, my girl from the other night was special.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也是个科学家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was a scientist too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:26.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  她高中毕业\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She was? Well, she graduated high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随便啦  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, whatever. Know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.07,0:14:30.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没时间跟你讲道理\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't have time to convince you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.57,0:14:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只会在这里待4个小时  我得去见他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's only here for four hours and I'm gonna go see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  对  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Fine. Fine! Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还在这里做什么  我说过了  龙虾饺子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you still doing here? I told you, lobster ravioli.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:44.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.63,0:14:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我正要离开  我以为你不会来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I was just about to leave. I didn't think you were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.76,0:14:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绝不会错过这次约会\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, I wouldn't have missed this. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你能来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, I'm very glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是个绅士\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you're such a gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  到我家去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, we're going to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想一个人独吞起司蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you eating the cheesecake without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.82,0:15:12.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要你现在能吹出口哨  我就给你一百块钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I will give you $100 to whistle right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么可以不管我  一个人独吞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can you eat the cheesecake without me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.75,0:15:20.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么做呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:24.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉摩妮卡或乔伊  不  你得把一切都告诉他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gonna run and tell Monica or Joey? No, you'd have to tell them what we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.88,0:15:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是甜点小偷  我们犯了法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are dessert stealers. We are living outside the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗  我不能让你跟蛋糕独处\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what? I don't trust you with this cake anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.47,0:15:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我先发现它的  我要把它拿回来  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I got it first, and I'm taking it back. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.26,0:15:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不  不  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Oh, no, you don't. Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我就能相信你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You think I trust you with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们平分它  你一半  我一半\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're gonna split it. You take half, I take half.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.15,0:15:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不公平   你已经吃掉一点了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not fair. You had some.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想摩妮卡一定想知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you know what? I think Monica would be very interested to know...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.94,0:15:49.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说她做的起司蛋糕 "又干又粗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that you called her cheesecake dry and mealy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们用什么来切蛋糕呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What do we use to split it? Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.95,0:15:57.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  各人拿一块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, pick a half. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:16:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这块比较大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, this side looks bigger. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:04.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这块饼干比较多\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, but there's more crust on this side.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我该量一下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. So maybe if I measure it--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.55,0:16:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  快挑一块\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}For God's sake, pick a piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:13.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我挑那块  那块比较小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I pick that one. So the smaller piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.64,0:16:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  拿去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好享受你的蛋糕吧  我的朋友  因为大势已定\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Enjoy your half, my friend. But that is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.10,0:16:22.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会跟你分  或跟你换   别哭着跑来找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No sharing, no switching, and don't come crying to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.89,0:16:24.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你一下子就把蛋糕都吃完了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if you eat your piece too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.32,0:16:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:39.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要给我点蛋糕吗  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gonna give me some of your piece? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.49,0:16:42.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会跟你分  或跟你换   别哭着跑来找我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No switching, no sharing. And don't come crying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.91,0:16:46.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要坐在这里  花一整天好好享用我的蛋糕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ha, ha. I may just sit here and have my cake all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.00,0:16:50.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要坐在走廊上吃我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just sit here in the hallway and eat my--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.31,0:17:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.35,0:17:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  米莉阿姨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, Aunt Millie.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.23,0:17:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个婚礼很温馨吧  对对  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Isn't it a beautiful wedding? Yes. Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她每次都亲嘴巴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Every time, on the lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.91,0:17:18.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么要亲嘴巴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why on the lips?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬妮在那边  她看到我一定会很高兴吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's Frannie. Won't she be happy to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.12,0:17:27.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  你得乖乖的  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, wait a minute. You be nice, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.29,0:17:29.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是带你来欺负她的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't bring you here so you could ambush her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.71,0:17:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬妮把你的《花花公子》拿给妈妈看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Frannie was the one who found your Playboys and showed them to Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个死小孩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.85,0:17:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica. What--?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.27,0:17:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在这里做什么  你看到我很惊讶吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Am I doing here? Surprised to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:47.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯带我来的  你还喜欢吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross brought me. How do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.65,0:17:49.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芬妮  恭喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Frannie. Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:55.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你邀请我的哥哥  我的家人  却不邀请我  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You invite my brother, you invite my whole family, and not me? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.32,0:17:57.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不希望我来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why wouldn't you want me at your wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做了什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What could I have possibly done?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.66,0:18:02.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,史都华\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stuart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你认识我丈夫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I believe you know my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.58,0:18:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题应该是   你把上了"谁"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So it's really a question of "who" could you have possibly done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌这样   但我得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I hate this, but I have to go. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能错过飞机\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't miss my flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.77,0:18:27.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敢说下一班飞往明斯克的飞机是在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you sure? I bet there's another flight to Minsk in--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,七月\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}July
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.49,0:18:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那真的好窝心  它是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's really beautiful. What does it mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"请帮我把杯子洗干净"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Please clean my beakers."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.79,0:18:46.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不常离开实验室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't get out of the lab much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.37,0:18:51.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为它有别的意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought it meant something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   事实上  我想说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, well, I really actually wanted to say, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.55,0:19:00.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想或许我不该说  因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, urn, I figured I probably shouldn't because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.18,0:19:03.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you know, I have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.72,0:19:06.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  你说的对  别说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hmm. No, you're right. Don't say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.27,0:19:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我真的那么想\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.57,0:19:24.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, bye, Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是时候  乔伊   明天你可以骂我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, now's not the time, Joey, all right? You can yell at me tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  不  不  菲比  我不会骂你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no. No, Pheebs. I'm not gonna yell at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.09,0:19:45.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是开始想到你跟大卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just started thinking about you and David...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.43,0:19:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得他第一次离开时  你是多难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I remember how bummed you were the first time he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.77,0:19:53.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Pheebs, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  不  我一点都不好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? No, I'm not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.69,0:20:02.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我唯一喜欢的男人要去明斯克\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only guy I've ever been crazy about is going to Minsk...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.32,0:20:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我永远都不会再见到他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I may never see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以去看他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you could always visit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对   你以为他们会给我护照\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, right. Like they're gonna let me have a passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么我可以帮忙的吗   什么都行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anything I can do? Whatever you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.29,0:20:18.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以比他先蒸馏出副原子粒子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...if you achieve positronic distillation of subatomic particles before he does...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.22,0:20:24.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他就可以回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then he could come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以试试看\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I could give it a shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.48,0:20:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看  有一小块没有沾到地板\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, look. There's a piece that doesn't have floor on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.53,0:20:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别越界  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Stick to your side. Come on, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.50,0:20:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们要吃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, what are we having?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.80,0:21:08.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  我忘了拿披肩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait, I forgot my wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.97,0:21:11.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧   你在这里等我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay, wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.49,0:21:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  甜心  你要走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, sweetie. Are you leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  亲阿姨一下  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well-Give us a kiss. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.30,0:21:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为什么要亲嘴巴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Why on the lips?
